# Large model artifacts and private data
#
# The packaged pose+bbox56 fall bundle is fully pinned (every member with
# sha256/size) in worker/tools/fetch_models/manifest.json and re-verified from
# its own bundle-manifest.json at load time, so nothing under models/ is
# tracked; scripts/fetch-models.sh provisions it.
models/
weights/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pte
*.tflite
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.h5
data/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a

# Generated experiments, evidence, and scratch
artifacts/
# Review-evidence scratch written by QA lanes; never committed (the privacy gate
# refuses raw capture payloads, and the ultragoal gate only needs the paths).
.artifacts/
experiments/loop_status.json
.scratch/
.gjc/
.omo/
.omc/
.omx/
.gstack/

# Editor and OS files
.DS_Store
.dataset-ops/

# mediamtx self-signed TLS artifacts (auto-generated in its cwd on startup;
# see tests/e2e_worker_relay_fixtures.py's MediaMtxProcess for the fixture
# that now isolates its cwd so these no longer land here)
auto.crt
auto.key

# Claude Code 작업 디렉터리. 에이전트 worktree 같은 로컬 산출물은 커밋하지
# 않되, `.claude/skills/` 는 저장소가 공유하는 운영 절차라 예외로 추적한다.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Working files written by .github/workflows/edge-images.yml during a run.
plan-ml-api.json
plan-ml-api.txt
plan-ml-worker.json
plan-ml-worker.txt
edge-ml-image-refs.env
